  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 32101ee2a63fba642a74fdcb0e93391b, type: 3}
  m_Name: EndingStoryData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp:DarkPixelGD.Story:StoryDataSO
  pages:
  - text: 'And somehow...

      After everything I went through...

      I went
      back.'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: 'I thought I understood this world.

      I built it. I controlled it.'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: 'But to her...

      It was everything.'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: 'Every trap. Every failure.

      Every time I pressed restart...'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: She had to live through it.
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: 'I don''t know if she was ever really alive.

      Maybe she wasn''t.

      Maybe
      it was just a bug.'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: But for the first time...
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: 'I wondered if being the creator

      meant I was always right.'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: I thought I was making a game.
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: 'Maybe I was making something

      I didn''t understand.'
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
  - text: I'm sorry.
    holdDurationAfterTyping: 2
